    ///   <a href="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/Owner">fibo-fnd-oac-own:Owner</a>
    /// </summary>
    let Owner = _prefixId.prefix "Owner"
    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>rdfs:label : owners' equity</para>
    ///   <para>skos:definition : owners' share in a business plus operating profit^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>cmns-av:adaptedFrom : Barron's Dictionary of Banking Terms, Sixth Edition, 2012.^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>cmns-av:explanatoryNote : Owner's equity is represented by capital investments and accumulated earnings less any dividends or other financial obligations. It is typically used to talk about equity in a business, but may also refer to the net assets of a pool or special purpose vehicle.^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>cmns-av:synonym : capitalcmns-av:synonym : contributed capitalcmns-av:synonym : equity^^xsd:stringcmns-av:synonym : net worth^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <a href="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/OwnersEquity">fibo-fnd-oac-own:OwnersEquity</a>
    /// </summary>
    let OwnersEquity = _prefixId.prefix "OwnersEquity"
    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>rdfs:label : ownership</para>
    ///   <para>skos:definition : situation in which some party holds the legal title to something (explicitly or implicitly) and has the right to transfer that title and/or possession^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>cmns-av:explanatoryNote : Ownership is the right to possess, use, sell, donate or give as a gift any asset or property belonging to a person known as the 'owner'. An owner can be either a beneficial owner or a legal owner.^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <a href="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/Ownership">fibo-fnd-oac-own:Ownership</a>
    /// </summary>
    let Ownership = _prefixId.prefix "Ownership"
    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>rdfs:label : paid-in capital^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>skos:definition : assets received from investors in exchange for an ownership interest^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <a href="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/PaidInCapital">fibo-fnd-oac-own:PaidInCapital</a>
    /// </summary>
    let PaidInCapital = _prefixId.prefix "PaidInCapital"
    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>rdfs:label : physical asset^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>skos:definition : tangible asset that has a material form, such as property, equipment, and inventory^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>cmns-av:explanatoryNote : Physical (tangible) assets are real items of value that are used to generate revenue for a company.^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <a href="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/PhysicalAsset">fibo-fnd-oac-own:PhysicalAsset</a>
    /// </summary>
    let PhysicalAsset = _prefixId.prefix "PhysicalAsset"
    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>rdfs:label : portfolio^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>skos:definition : collection of holdings assembled and maintained as a unit for management purposes to achieve strategic objectives^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>cmns-av:adaptedFrom : http://www.investopedia.com/terms/h/holdings.asp^^xsd:anyURIcmns-av:adaptedFrom : http://www.investopedia.com/terms/p/portfolio.asp^^xsd:anyURI</para>
    ///   <para>cmns-av:explanatoryNote : The holdings of any given portfolio may include a variety of investment products, including stocks, bonds and mutual funds to options, futures and exchange-traded funds, and relatively esoteric instruments such as private equity and hedge funds as well as other assets of the owner, such as interests in real estate, art, or vehicles.
    ///
    /// With respect to financial assets, the number and nature of holdings contribute to the degree of diversification of a portfolio. A mix of stocks across different sectors, bonds of different maturities, and other investments would suggest a well-diversified portfolio, while concentrated holdings in a handful of stocks within a single sector indicates a portfolio with limited diversification.^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <a href="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/Portfolio">fibo-fnd-oac-own:Portfolio</a>
    /// </summary>
    let Portfolio = _prefixId.prefix "Portfolio"
    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>rdfs:label : retained earnings^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>skos:definition : net profits kept to accumulate in a business after dividends are paid^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>cmns-av:explanatoryNote : If the corporation takes a loss, then that loss is retained and called variously retained losses, accumulated losses or accumulated deficit. Retained earnings and losses are cumulative from year to year with losses offsetting earnings.^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <a href="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/RetainedEarnings">fibo-fnd-oac-own:RetainedEarnings</a>
    /// </summary>
    let RetainedEarnings = _prefixId.prefix "RetainedEarnings"
    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>rdfs:label : shareholders' equity^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>skos:definition : equity that is manifested in the form of shares in an entity, fund or structured product</para>
    ///   <a href="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/ShareholdersEquity">fibo-fnd-oac-own:ShareholdersEquity</a>
    /// </summary>
    let ShareholdersEquity = _prefixId.prefix "ShareholdersEquity"
    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>rdfs:label : tangible asset^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>skos:definition : asset that is a physical, measurable resource, i.e., one that takes a physical form^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <para>cmns-av:explanatoryNote : Tangible assets include cash, cash equivalents and accounts receivables (AR), inventory, equipment, buildings and real estate, crops, and investments. Tangible assets such as art, furniture, stamps, gold, wine, toys and books of significant value may be included in an individual or organization's asset portfolio.^^xsd:string</para>
    ///   <a href="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/TangibleAsset">fibo-fnd-oac-own:TangibleAsset</a>
    /// </summary>
    let TangibleAsset = _prefixId.prefix "TangibleAsset"
    /// <summary>
    ///   <para>rdfs:label : has acquisition price^^xsd:string</para>
